				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
		)
		(uuid "224dd707-217f-4019-909e-873a3ca11f51")
	)
	(text "Address straps per SLVSH04 Table 8-28: leaf1 0/0 -> 0x60, leaf2 0/1 -> 0x64, leaf3 1/0 -> 0x6C, leaf4 1/1 -> 0x70, yaw Z/0 -> 0x66 (write addresses). High straps via 2.2k per TI; low straps tied to GND; Hi-Z left open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 200 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
		)
		(uuid "76366044-b38f-4f4f-b9df-0f99c32acb24")
	)
	(text "MC3_COL_MAIN_V1.0 - MC3 collimator main control board. Vault build rung: Projects/MC3 Collimator/05 Builds/Main-Board-01. Four leaf channels fitted (DRV8214, COL-COTS-0028); yaw reserved at the MCU only. A1/A0 I2C address straps per leaf: leaf1 GND/GND, leaf2 GND/+3V3, leaf3 +3V3/GND, leaf4 +3V3/+3V3 (PROVISIONAL). Net naming: vault V3_3 == +3V3, vault VIN_RAW == VM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 130 0)
